# Triple Triad: Bot1's library is empty at its upkeep on turn 5 (its eight cards: seven in hand, one drawn on turn 3), so it exiles
# no card of its own. Bot2's Lightning Bolt is still exiled, but with no card of Bot1's to be lesser than, Bot1 may not cast it
# (the game ends at the draw step that follows, which Bot1 cannot survive).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Triple Triad
Island
Island
Island

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x9
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Triple Triad.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile.Count = 1
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 1
